{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.poster.avif?t=1772898641\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.webm?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.mp4?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built to Hunt. Broken to Think.</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Recycler. Your function is simple: track down war deserters. But when a highway explosion destroys your transport, it cracks your programming. Now trapped in the steel city of Sunket, you're experiencing a glitch of memories and voices. Find the truth before your makers decide you\u2019ve learned too much.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Voices in Your Head</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fractured consciousness is split into three voices. Decide which will lead your mind: deconstruct chaos with condescending logic, command every room with cold-blooded cool, or eavesdrop on the memories stained into the world. Let them guide you\u2026 or tear you in different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/644242d7f6ae4cca6456812d87ec1088.poster.avif?t=1772898641\" width=804 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/644242d7f6ae4cca6456812d87ec1088.webm?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/644242d7f6ae4cca6456812d87ec1088.mp4?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Instrument That Whispers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Listening Device</strong> is your guide. Use it to intercept hidden frequencies, uncover surface thoughts, and track electronic echoes. Follow the static trails to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/0b3645d6b1130c4b5d5e8652b6913369.poster.avif?t=1772898641\" width=804 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/0b3645d6b1130c4b5d5e8652b6913369.webm?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/0b3645d6b1130c4b5d5e8652b6913369.mp4?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sunket: A City on the Brink</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers vanish inside the factories. Smoke chokes the streets. The city\u2019s leaders are unraveling, and something whispers from beneath the pavement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, uncover who targeted your transport. <strong>When your makers learn you\u2019ve awakened, will you remain a tool... or become something they fear?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3082700?t=1772898641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/feb13e4aec35af410009361fb819e80cb5de228e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772898641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/3d4c83fbd1b516c637967c71cab0cc83a256630a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772898641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/3d4c83fbd1b516c637967c71cab0cc83a256630a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772898641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Sunset Inferno contains strong language, references to drug and alcohol use, and mild violence with limited blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.poster.avif?t=1772898641\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.webm?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.mp4?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built to Hunt. Broken to Think.</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Recycler. Your function is simple: track down war deserters. But when a highway explosion destroys your transport, it cracks your programming. Now trapped in the steel city of Sunket, you're experiencing a glitch of memories and voices. Find the truth before your makers decide you\u2019ve learned too much.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Voices in Your Head</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fractured consciousness is split into three voices. Decide which will lead your mind: deconstruct chaos with condescending logic, command every room with cold-blooded cool, or eavesdrop on the memories stained into the world. Let them guide you\u2026 or tear you in different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/644242d7f6ae4cca6456812d87ec1088.poster.avif?t=1772898641\" width=804 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/644242d7f6ae4cca6456812d87ec1088.webm?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/644242d7f6ae4cca6456812d87ec1088.mp4?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Instrument That Whispers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Listening Device</strong> is your guide. Use it to intercept hidden frequencies, uncover surface thoughts, and track electronic echoes. Follow the static trails to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/0b3645d6b1130c4b5d5e8652b6913369.poster.avif?t=1772898641\" width=804 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/0b3645d6b1130c4b5d5e8652b6913369.webm?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/0b3645d6b1130c4b5d5e8652b6913369.mp4?t=1772898641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sunket: A City on the Brink</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers vanish inside the factories. Smoke chokes the streets. The city\u2019s leaders are unraveling, and something whispers from beneath the pavement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, uncover who targeted your transport. <strong>When your makers learn you\u2019ve awakened, will you remain a tool... or become something they fear?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Treasured Trash"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/517d77f2202fb62b448cca863506ffe9fccca7b2/header.jpg?t=1772898641","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3082700/1434425229/468ff7551966a38d62863f1ac5360b6c6aaf7755/1770834978/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770836293","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3082700/1434425229/468ff7551966a38d62863f1ac5360b6c6aaf7755/1770834978/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770836293","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3082700/1434425229/468ff7551966a38d62863f1ac5360b6c6aaf7755/1770834978/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770836293","id":257076905,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076905/951208e0f0b7bbb3741192df12db0d945a056139/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770836293"}],"name":"Sunset Inferno","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Treasured Trash"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nViol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogen\nSelbstmord","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","requi